    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 740ed74354aa6984991a3517ac47640b, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54ed9f9b6d18a0e47bde29f2a04b4be2, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 740ed74354aa6984991a3517ac47640b, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54ed9f9b6d18a0e47bde29f2a04b4be2, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 740ed74354aa6984991a3517ac47640b, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54ed9f9b6d18a0e47bde29f2a04b4be2, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Hm, it looks like this game show is rigged against me!
    - 'Any typical game show contestent would be panicking right about now.

      But not me.'
    - That's because I have you, a time travelling wizard on my side.
    - "With a little timeline manipulation, and some very direct instructions from
      you, \nI have a hunch that we can beat *any* challenge this game show throws
      at us!"
    - 'This is the timeline of all the inputs.

      Press the "W" or "Up Arrow" Key to

      jump to the most recent input.'
    - '


      It looks like we chose the wrong option.

      Let''s correct that!'
    - "By the way, if you ever need some good advice,\r\nyou can click on the \"Winnerman's
      live reaction\"\r\nbutton to hear my own thoughts on the situation."
    - 'When you''re ready to resume time,

      you can click the "toggle pause" button,

      or hit spacebar.'
    Clip:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: bc1ac20b83e82e8419ca4349a42a95d8, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6312043ce5c052d4bab28046ef4eb627, type: 3}
